        "description": "Checks whether the API is running and confirms database connectivity.\n\nExpected result:\n\n- HTTP 200\n    \n- response time below 1000 ms\n    \n- response is JSON\n    \n- message = \"API is working\"\n    \n- database = \"connected\""
